msgid "QUEST_SEWER_TREASURE"
msgstr "The Family in the Bottle"

msgid "QUEST_SEWER_TREASURE_DESC"
msgstr "The Old Drunk lost his family to Lucifer, who tore out their souls and bottled them in a storm of glass. Go down the manhole to the cellar of the Necromancer, the alchemist who stitches the dead, defeat him and bring the Bottle of the Soul Storm to the old man, who promises everything he has left. The rats are Earth: they fear Fire."

