msgid "VALUABLE_KEY_OSSUARY"
msgstr "Ossuary Key"

msgid "VALUABLE_KEY_OSSUARY_DESC"
msgstr "Given by the Gravedigger. The Crypt Guardian asks for it, with the other key, to open the Crypt Lord's gate."

msgid "VALUABLE_KEY_CRYPT"
msgstr "Crypt Key"

msgid "VALUABLE_KEY_CRYPT_DESC"
msgstr "Given by the Caretaker. The Crypt Guardian asks for it, with the other key, to open the Crypt Lord's gate."

msgid "NPC_CE_GRAVEDIGGER"
msgstr "Gravedigger Abel"

msgid "NPC_CE_CARETAKER"
msgstr "Caretaker Mirta"

msgid "NPC_CE_WARDEN"
msgstr "Crypt Guardian"

msgid "QUEST_CE_LUNGS"
msgstr "The Gravedigger's Lungs"

msgid "QUEST_CE_LUNGS_DESC"
msgstr "Gravedigger Abel wants the Human Lungs the Crypt Ogre carries. Take his book, wake the Ogre at the avenue altar and bring the lungs; he hands over the Ossuary Key."

msgid "QUEST_CE_LANTERN"
msgstr "The Sentinel's Lantern"

msgid "QUEST_CE_LANTERN_DESC"
msgstr "Caretaker Mirta wants the Lantern the Tomb Sentinel keeps. Take her book, wake the Sentinel at the avenue altar and bring the lantern; she hands over the Crypt Key."

msgid "QUEST_CE_GATE"
msgstr "The Crypt Gate"

msgid "QUEST_CE_GATE_DESC"
msgstr "The Crypt Guardian only opens the Crypt Lord's gate for those who hand him the Ossuary Key and the Crypt Key."

msgid "DLG_CEGRAVE_1"
msgstr "I have dug graves for forty years and never buried a corpse as stubborn as the Crypt Ogre. He kept the lungs of someone he should not have."

msgid "DLG_CEGRAVE_2"
msgstr "If you bring the Human Lungs back, I will give you the ossuary key. The Ogre only wakes at the avenue altar, with the right book."

msgid "DLG_CEGRAVE_3"
msgstr "Watch his club: it has opened more graves than I have."

msgid "DLG_CEGRAVE_ACTIVE"
msgstr "The lungs are still with the Ogre, at the avenue altar. Without them, the ossuary key stays with me."

msgid "DLG_CEGRAVE_DONE"
msgstr "Rest, brave ones. That poor king will breathe in peace, wherever he is."

msgid "DLG_CECARE_1"
msgstr "I have lit this cemetery's lanterns for so long I lost count. The last and oldest one, the Tomb Sentinel took for himself."

msgid "DLG_CECARE_2"
msgstr "Bring it back and I will hand you the crypt key. The Sentinel dwells in the avenue altar's statue: only the book I give you wakes him."

msgid "DLG_CECARE_3"
msgstr "He is made of stone, but holds a grudge like a person."

msgid "DLG_CECARE_ACTIVE"
msgstr "The lantern is still with the Sentinel. Without it, the crypt key stays with me."

msgid "DLG_CECARE_DONE"
msgstr "The light is back on the avenue. The dead are grateful, in their way."

msgid "DLG_CEWARD_1"
msgstr "The Crypt Lord sleeps behind this gate, and I make sure no one disturbs him without deserving it."

msgid "DLG_CEWARD_2"
msgstr "Whoever brings me the Ossuary Key, from the Gravedigger, and the Crypt Key, from the Caretaker, may pass. Only the two together open the gate."

msgid "DLG_CEWARD_3"
msgstr "The mini-bosses wait at the avenue altar. Without them, there are no keys."

msgid "DLG_CEWARD_ACTIVE"
msgstr "Keys are still missing. Speak with the Gravedigger and the Caretaker."

msgid "DLG_CEWARD_DONE"
msgstr "The gate is open. May the Crypt Lord find you ready."

msgid "VALUABLE_CEMETERY_BOOK_1"
msgstr "Gravedigger's Roll"

msgid "VALUABLE_CEMETERY_BOOK_1_DESC"
msgstr "Given by Gravedigger Abel. Take the group to the Avenue Altar: read before the stone, the book awakens Crypt Ogre. It vanishes from the bag when Crypt Ogre falls. It cannot be sold or lost."

msgid "DLG_CEMETERY_BOOK_1"
msgstr "Take this book, Gravedigger's Roll, to the Avenue Altar: read before the stone, it awakens Crypt Ogre. Bring me Human Lungs, which it keeps, and I will hand you the key."

msgid "VALUABLE_CEMETERY_BOOK_2"
msgstr "Caretaker's Register"

msgid "VALUABLE_CEMETERY_BOOK_2_DESC"
msgstr "Given by Caretaker Mirta. Take the group to the Avenue Altar: read before the stone, the book awakens Tomb Sentinel. It vanishes from the bag when Tomb Sentinel falls. It cannot be sold or lost."

msgid "DLG_CEMETERY_BOOK_2"
msgstr "Take this book, Caretaker's Register, to the Avenue Altar: read before the stone, it awakens Tomb Sentinel. Bring me Sentinel's Lantern, which it keeps, and I will hand you the key."

msgid "NPC_CEMETERY_ALTAR"
msgstr "Avenue Altar"

msgid "DLG_CEMETERY_ALTAR_1"
msgstr "You rest Gravedigger's Roll on the stone of the Avenue Altar and read aloud. The ground shakes, and Crypt Ogre rises before the altar."

msgid "DLG_CEMETERY_ALTAR_2"
msgstr "You rest Caretaker's Register on the stone of the Avenue Altar and read aloud. The air grows heavy, and Tomb Sentinel appears before the altar."

msgid "DLG_CEMETERY_ALTAR_LOCKED"
msgstr "The stone does not react. There is an empty gap in the center, the size of a book: Gravedigger's Roll or Caretaker's Register must hold what is missing."

msgid "TOAST_BREAKABLE_MIMIC"
msgstr "It was a Mimic!"
